


Sephetho ngola: ['Number:'].
>> a := Palo + Palo + 1.
a := Palo - 2.
a := Palo × 2.
a := Palo ÷ 2.
Sephetho ngola: a.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.

Sephetho ngola: ['String:'].
Sephetho ngola: Mongolo bolelele.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.

Sephetho ngola: ['File:'].
Sephetho ngola: Faele bala.
Sephetho ngola: (Faele ngola: ['test']).
Sephetho ngola: (Faele eketsa-qetellong: ['test']).
Sephetho ngola: Faele hlakola.
Sephetho ngola: Faele e-teng.
Sephetho ngola: Faele include.
Sephetho ngola: Faele qala.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.


Sephetho ngola: ['Array:'].
Sephetho ngola: Lethathamo ntsha-ea-ho-qetela.
Sephetho ngola: Lethathamo palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: (((Lethathamo eketsa-qetellong: 999) mongolo) nkela-sebaka: ['Lĳst'] ka: ['List']).
Sephetho ngola: Lethathamo palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: Lethathamo ntsha-ea-pele.
Sephetho ngola: (Lethathamo kopanya: [',']).
>> f := Lethathamo ncha.
Sephetho ngola: f palo-ea-lintho. 
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.

Sephetho ngola: ['Map:'].
Sephetho ngola: Bukantswe palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: (Bukantswe beha: ['a'] sebakeng: ['b'])  palo-ea-lintho. 
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.




